Z||000004||DecadenceR||06-07-2001||11:30 AM||||Sad thing is almost all of the mustangs on there are brand new, stock.<BR>Now I have respect for old school mustangs.<BR>As dor any newer ones... No.<BR>I'm a camaro boy, and I find it hard to swallow that a smaller, slightly ligher Mustang GT 8cyl stock can be beat by a longer, heavier stock 6cyl Camaro. But, that's why they make 54 flavors, right?<P>Anyway, back to my point. ANY new car is going to look nice. Now if you want me to look at your ride, show me your nice custom paint or body work or something like that. Dont go showing me your new 2001 Rustang that mommy and daddy bought for you with the hood up to make it look like you've got something you don't. (that goes for all the brand new still stock cars they had on there, not just the Ford products)<BR>Thank you, have a good day.<BR>HAA HAA HAA||||reg||1
Z||000005||Slammed Fiero||06-07-2001||11:40 AM||||because there are 1000000000 mustangs ont he road. Some Fiero people like Mudstains too. My mom has a 5.0ltr convert. It's a fun car, lots of torque , predictable handling.<P>Mustang and Fiero are not in the same class at all. mid engined 2 seater 4 wheel independant suspension vs 4 seater , live axle front engine car??<P>I think a lot of Fiero people don't like 5.0ltrs because they see there tailights too often.<P>My moms is a 95 is a slouch and my Fiero will beat it. But for every fast fiero , there are far more as fast or faster mustangs.<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
Z||000006||DecadenceR||06-07-2001||11:45 AM||||Speed wise, Mustangs are very respectable cars. But personally I NEVER liked Fords. They have so much potential. And none of it is used. (sounds like a Pontiac car we all know and love) My friend had a 99 Cobra. That thing had ballz like you wouldn't believe. I respected that car. Never liked it though.<BR>In the few races that I have lost, I have never been rude or anything like that. If you came up driving a Pinto with NOS and toasted me, i'd be shocked as **** . I'd never bad mouth your car. But no matter how fast it was, i still don't like it. <BR>Like i said though, it's a fued thing between Stangs and Camaros. Very very very few people like both.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Master_Sushi||06-07-2001||12:21 PM||||My Fiero was on ridejudge a month or two ago. My average vote was 1-2  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. All the riced out imports seemed to get the highest scores. So I got mad and took it off. Its because Fieros have such a bad rep., and most people know nothing about them.<P>O well||||reg||1
Z||000008||The Fieromaster||06-07-2001||02:34 PM||||Master_Sushi is right... I seen that wicked orangeish fiero on there got only like a 3.0 and a pimped out Cougar (99) has a like 8.0 WTF so if we RICER RONIIFY our Fiero we will win?  I do like the new Cougars there nice lookin but comon its not Rice!!  and like earlier said ITS NEW it shines easy... What about Fieros that 9 times outta 10 need some HELLA Help looking "Evil" again!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">   <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
